3. Underlying review data
-------------------------
The derived datasets are computed from ICLR peer reviews published on
OpenReview (https://openreview.net), which are themselves released under
CC BY 4.0. This repository redistributes only aggregated and derived
quantities; the underlying review texts remain subject to OpenReview's
terms and their authors' rights.
